# Normalise line endings so a repo shared between Windows and macOS/Linux
# does not churn, and so the .mjs hook scripts in .claude/hooks/ stay LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files git should never try to normalise or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary

